{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/54aaccbee85476a04a19519e4757fdcb.poster.avif?t=1763811771\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/54aaccbee85476a04a19519e4757fdcb.webm?t=1763811771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/54aaccbee85476a04a19519e4757fdcb.mp4?t=1763811771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amy\u2019s brother is dead. She hadn't even seen him in years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thomas has always been a little eccentric. Obsessed with lucid dreaming and the concept of other worlds. All a little too fantastical for a small town vet like Amy herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then Amy comes across his journals. And what at first seems like the ramblings of a troubled mind slowly begin to seem more and more plausible. Maybe her brother was right about everything. And maybe, just maybe\u2026 he isn\u2019t actually dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Sleep: Labyrinth of the Forsaken is a point-and-click horror adventure from veteran developer scriptwelder, and a standalone entry into the cult classic Deep Sleep series. Guide Amy deeper into the world of dreams, using the power of her mind to shape her surroundings and overcome challenges and puzzles. Explore landscapes both beautiful and terrifying in your search to uncover the truth about her brother. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there\u2019s a darkness lurking within the mazes of these other worlds. It knows Amy is there. And it\u2019s very, very interested in finding her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features the exploration, atmosphere, narrative, and puzzles you've come to expect and love while also adding in a sneakily complex turn-based combat system, many items to be looted and used in various ways, and a skill tree to help you overcome these nightmarish challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/95df6ae23aa4de192bf7c69fc5dc26c5.poster.avif?t=1763811771\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/95df6ae23aa4de192bf7c69fc5dc26c5.webm?t=1763811771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/95df6ae23aa4de192bf7c69fc5dc26c5.mp4?t=1763811771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and defeat foes using the ability to shape Amy\u2019s dreams around her</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore nightmarish and otherworldly environments with elements of randomized design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve and unlock new skills for Amy to help keep her alive and make her stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter bizarre and dangerous beings who could be friend, foe\u2026 or both</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and secrets to find, if you survive the beings hunting you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new soundtrack from composer Christopher Carlone</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/94b0e8499706694b0b543481c1257c1c.poster.avif?t=1763811771\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/94b0e8499706694b0b543481c1257c1c.webm?t=1763811771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/94b0e8499706694b0b543481c1257c1c.mp4?t=1763811771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Run, Amy, Run!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868360/e73e8688edae42c7255ff0a27800a9aa145b591d.jpg"},{"name":"The Guardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868360/e76e9c98d9be0b588e18be2343a01ab8cd4df4c7.jpg"},{"name":"Arachnophobia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868360/f48804a8902502c5f1d2f5ea0010a534fe0218c3.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Puppets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868360/1571c2ff5d52ee3fbce630b6c90724ae7f645323.jpg"},{"name":"No Encore","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868360/8b6862e011c22931a8ea80a13cce1b1acb1bea46.jpg"},{"name":"Justice served","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868360/f768e6033d6703fe6e40c1c6f09d52b1badde0d8.jpg"},{"name":"Wake Up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868360/be319219a20caf9c6003543f4f0574708fb9f7ba.jpg"},{"name":"Goodbye, Brother","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868360/a621a9c5e792a717c82634cb05804c088efff722.jpg"},{"name":"I Banish Thee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868360/6c2d9db48cdbfe92ecf90c68310277163f9edeaa.jpg"},{"name":"The Darkest Hour","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1868360/8c93d4632d6ce4c96ee00d1e493c790081fae2c6.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1868360?t=1763811771","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1868360?t=1763811771","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763811771","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763811771","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains pixelated violence without explicit or frequent gore. There are moments intended to frighten or provide jumpscares, as well as more serious topics like death."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2914450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/54aaccbee85476a04a19519e4757fdcb.poster.avif?t=1763811771\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/54aaccbee85476a04a19519e4757fdcb.webm?t=1763811771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/54aaccbee85476a04a19519e4757fdcb.mp4?t=1763811771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amy\u2019s brother is dead. She hadn't even seen him in years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thomas has always been a little eccentric. Obsessed with lucid dreaming and the concept of other worlds. All a little too fantastical for a small town vet like Amy herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then Amy comes across his journals. And what at first seems like the ramblings of a troubled mind slowly begin to seem more and more plausible. Maybe her brother was right about everything. And maybe, just maybe\u2026 he isn\u2019t actually dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Sleep: Labyrinth of the Forsaken is a point-and-click horror adventure from veteran developer scriptwelder, and a standalone entry into the cult classic Deep Sleep series. Guide Amy deeper into the world of dreams, using the power of her mind to shape her surroundings and overcome challenges and puzzles. Explore landscapes both beautiful and terrifying in your search to uncover the truth about her brother. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there\u2019s a darkness lurking within the mazes of these other worlds. It knows Amy is there. And it\u2019s very, very interested in finding her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features the exploration, atmosphere, narrative, and puzzles you've come to expect and love while also adding in a sneakily complex turn-based combat system, many items to be looted and used in various ways, and a skill tree to help you overcome these nightmarish challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/95df6ae23aa4de192bf7c69fc5dc26c5.poster.avif?t=1763811771\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/95df6ae23aa4de192bf7c69fc5dc26c5.webm?t=1763811771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/95df6ae23aa4de192bf7c69fc5dc26c5.mp4?t=1763811771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and defeat foes using the ability to shape Amy\u2019s dreams around her</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore nightmarish and otherworldly environments with elements of randomized design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve and unlock new skills for Amy to help keep her alive and make her stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter bizarre and dangerous beings who could be friend, foe\u2026 or both</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and secrets to find, if you survive the beings hunting you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new soundtrack from composer Christopher Carlone</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/94b0e8499706694b0b543481c1257c1c.poster.avif?t=1763811771\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/94b0e8499706694b0b543481c1257c1c.webm?t=1763811771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868360/extras/94b0e8499706694b0b543481c1257c1c.mp4?t=1763811771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["scriptwelder"],"genres":[{"descriptio